	["Cast {spell:18960}"] = "Sešli {spell:18960}",
	["Cast {spell:18960}. With both half pendants in your bags, stand by the {area:2362} on the north-west shore of the lake and use a half to join them, then go to {npc:11802} in {area:2361}. {npc:11802} stands upstairs in his building: go up inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart."] = "Sešli {spell:18960}. S oběma polovinami přívěsku v taškách si stoupni k {area:2362} na severozápadním břehu jezera a jednou polovinou je spoj, pak jdi za {npc:11802} do {area:2361}. {npc:11802} stojí nahoře ve své budově: jdi nahoru uvnitř, šipka patra nerozliší.",
