	["At 10 {npc:3170}, the rogue trainer in {area:362}, sends you to {quest:1859} in {zone:1454}. It is only a pointer: an Orc already in {zone:1454} can skip it and take {quest:1963} from {quest:1859} straight away."] = "Na 10 tě {npc:3170}, trenér rogue v {area:362}, pošle k {quest:1859} v {zone:1454}. Je to jen rozcestník: Ork, který už je v {zone:1454}, ho může přeskočit a vzít {quest:1963} od {quest:1859} rovnou.",
