	["An {item:12800} comes from Thorium veins and obsidian, about one vein in a hundred; a {item:18335} drops rarely from elites of level 59 and up (Revanchion and {npc:14695} about one kill in nine and one in a hundred). The Auction House is the usual source of both."] = "{item:12800} pochází z Thorium žil a obsidiánu, zhruba jedna žíla ze sta; {item:18335} vzácně padá z elitů levelu 59 a výš (Revanchion a {npc:14695} zhruba jedno zabití z devíti a jedno ze sta). Obojí se obvykle kupuje v aukci.",
	["Arcanite Bars x6: an alchemist, or the Trade District Auction House"] = "Arcanite Bars x6: alchymista, nebo aukce v Trade District",
	["At 60 {npc:5149} in the {object:32362} sends you to {quest:7670} in {zone:1453}'s Cathedral of Light."] = "Na 60 tě {npc:5149} v {object:32362} pošle k {quest:7670} do Cathedral of Light v {zone:1453}.",
