	["Below ground"] = "Pod zemí",
	["Coming from the {zone:2548}: {area:340}'s flight master stands at the foot of the fortress."] = "Když jdeš z {zone:2548}: letový mistr {area:340} stojí u paty pevnosti.",
	["Flown in to {area:976}: the raceway is a short ride north over the {zone:1446} border.\nThe road from {area:484} to {zone:1446} runs past the {area:2240} on the {area:439}: {npc:4454} is in the gnomes' camp beside the track, {npc:4630} and {npc:4709} by the goblins' camp. {npc:4630} first, then {npc:4709}, who runs off to keep Rizzle busy; then take Rizzle's plans from the gnomes' camp and bring them back to {npc:4630}."] = "Přiletěl jsi do {area:976}: závodní dráha je kousek jízdy na sever přes hranici {zone:1446}.\nCesta z {area:484} do {zone:1446} vede kolem {area:2240} na {area:439}: {npc:4454} je v táboře gnómů vedle dráhy, {npc:4630} a {npc:4709} u tábora goblinů. Nejdřív {npc:4630}, pak {npc:4709}, který odběhne zaměstnat Rizzla; pak vezmi Rizzlovy plány z tábora gnómů a přines je zpátky {npc:4630}.",
	["Flown in: {area:976}'s quests first, by the flight master, then the {area:2240} is a short ride north over the {zone:1446} border."] = "Přiletěl jsi: nejdřív questy v {area:976} u letového mistra, pak je {area:2240} kousek jízdy na sever přes hranici {zone:1446}.",
