	["Back south to {npc:7775}. Keep the elixir and don't drink it yet: it kills you, and that is how you meet Gaeriyan by {area:976} later."] = "Zpět na jih k {npc:7775}. Elixír si nech a zatím ho nepij: zabije tě, a právě tak později potkáš Gaeriyana u {area:976}.",
	["Both {item:14047} donations are handed in later in the route: save sixty {item:14047} for each if you want them."] = "Oba dary {item:14047} se na trase odevzdávají později: pokud je chceš, nech si na každý šedesát {item:14047}.",
