	["Back up from the den to {npc:257551} and {npc:251366} in the village before heading south-west to {npc:252095}: the road from her camp leads on south to Shen'dar."] = "Zpět nahoru z doupěte k {npc:257551} a {npc:251366} ve vesnici, než se vydáš na jihozápad k {npc:252095}: cesta z jejího tábora vede dál na jih do Shen'daru.",
