	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:7430} (from 50, 1s 50c) and {spell:3924} (from 50, 1s 50c)."] = "Zpět k trenérovi {skill:202}: {spell:7430} (od 50, 1s 50c) a {spell:3924} (od 50, 1s 50c).",
	["Back to an {skill:202} trainer: {spell:8334} (from 100)."] = "Zpět k trenérovi {skill:202}: {spell:8334} (od 100).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 18 {item:2880} (18s) and {item:5956} (a tool: one, kept in your bags, 18c); about 18s 18c in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 18 {item:2880} (18s) a {item:5956} (nástroj: jeden, zůstává v taškách, 18c); celkem asi 18s 18c. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} a {npc:1286}).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 31 {item:6530} (31s); about 31s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5494} and {npc:1286})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 31 {item:6530} (31s); celkem asi 31s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:5494} a {npc:1286}).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 45 {item:2880} (45s); about 45s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} and {npc:1286})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 45 {item:2880} (45s); celkem asi 45s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:5519}, {npc:5514} a {npc:1286}).",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225 for 50s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs {skill:202} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}); Horde {npc:11017} ({zone:1454}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:9271} (from 150) and {spell:3953} (from 145). 150-225 takes about 31s of vendor goods, plus 19 {item:2319}, 19 {item:2592}, 31 {item:2836}, 74 {item:2838}, 100 {item:2841}, 6 {item:2842}, 81 {item:3575}, 19 {item:3860} and 62 {item:7912} to gather or buy."] = "Expert zvedne strop ze 150 na 225 za 50s (cena Classicu; ceny Foreveru v datech nejsou); potřebuje {skill:202} 125 a level postavy 20, takže ho můžeš vzít při jakékoli návštěvě od 125. Učí ho jen pár trenérů: Aliance {npc:5174} ({zone:1455}); Horda {npc:11017} ({zone:1454}). Šipka vybere nejbližšího z tvé frakce. Nauč se teď: {spell:9271} (od 150) a {spell:3953} (od 145). 150–225 stojí asi 31s za zboží od obchodníků, plus 19 {item:2319}, 19 {item:2592}, 31 {item:2836}, 74 {item:2838}, 100 {item:2841}, 6 {item:2842}, 81 {item:3575}, 19 {item:3860} a 62 {item:7912} k nasbírání nebo koupi.",
	["Expert {skill:202}"] = "Expert {skill:202}",
