	["373 {item:4304} for {item:8176} and {item:8193}: {skill:393}: beasts of level 38-50. Skin {npc:5292}, {npc:5300}, {npc:5304}, {npc:5272}, {npc:5260}, {npc:5262}, {npc:5268}, {npc:5274}, {npc:5287}, {npc:5286} and {npc:5296} here (level 38-50); the {skill:393} guide routes this."] = "373 {item:4304} pro {item:8176} a {item:8193}: {skill:393}: zvířata levelu 38–50. Stahuj {npc:5292}, {npc:5300}, {npc:5304}, {npc:5272}, {npc:5260}, {npc:5262}, {npc:5268}, {npc:5274}, {npc:5287}, {npc:5286} a {npc:5296} tady (level 38–50); trasu vede návod na {skill:393}.",
	["430 {item:14047} for {item:15094}: humanoids of level 45-60 drop it. Keep what you loot as you level, or take it from your bank."] = "430 {item:14047} pro {item:15094}: dropují ho humanoidi levelu 45–60. Nech si, co nalootuješ při levelování, nebo si ho vezmi z banky.",
	["Apprentice {skill:165} lets you craft up to 75 for 10c, at any character level. Not every {skill:165} trainer teaches it: Alliance {npc:1632} ({zone:1429}), {npc:11083} ({zone:1457}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:1466} ({zone:1455}), {npc:251993} ({zone:2521}), {npc:3605} ({zone:1438}) and {npc:11096} ({zone:1453}); Horde {npc:3069} ({zone:1412}), {npc:223} ({zone:1458}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:251993} ({zone:2521}), {npc:5811} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3008} ({zone:1456}) and {npc:3549} ({zone:1420}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Pair it with {skill:393}: {item:2318} comes from the beasts of every starting zone. {item:2320} and Salt are sold by leatherworking and trade supplies vendors. 1-75 takes about 1s 50c of recipes and 5s of vendor goods, plus 349 {item:2318} to gather or buy."] = "Apprentice {skill:165} ti dovolí vyrábět až do 75 za 10c, na jakémkoli levelu postavy. Ne každý trenér {skill:165} ho učí: Aliance {npc:1632} ({zone:1429}), {npc:11083} ({zone:1457}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:1466} ({zone:1455}), {npc:251993} ({zone:2521}), {npc:3605} ({zone:1438}) a {npc:11096} ({zone:1453}); Horda {npc:3069} ({zone:1412}), {npc:223} ({zone:1458}), {npc:252376} ({zone:2521}), {npc:251993} ({zone:2521}), {npc:5811} ({zone:1454}), {npc:3008} ({zone:1456}) a {npc:3549} ({zone:1420}). Šipka vybere nejbližšího z tvé frakce. Spoj ho s {skill:393}: {item:2318} je ze zvířat v každé startovní zóně. {item:2320} a Salt prodávají obchodníci s kožedělnými potřebami a surovinami. 1–75 stojí asi 1s 50c za recepty a 5s za zboží od obchodníků, plus 349 {item:2318} k nasbírání nebo koupi.",
	["Artisan raises the cap from 225 to 300; it needs {skill:165} 200 and character level 35, so you can take it on any visit from 200. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horde {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:19058} (from 225). 225-300 takes about 3g 40s of recipes and 44g 90s of vendor goods, plus 1029 {item:8170} and 430 {item:14047} to gather or buy."] = "Artisan zvedne strop z 225 na 300; potřebuje {skill:165} 200 a level postavy 35, takže ho můžeš vzít při jakékoli návštěvě od 200. Učí ho jen pár trenérů: Aliance {npc:11097} ({zone:1425}); Horda {npc:11098} ({zone:1444}). Šipka vybere nejbližšího z tvé frakce. Nauč se teď: {spell:19058} (od 225). 225–300 stojí asi 3g 40s za recepty a 44g 90s za zboží od obchodníků, plus 1029 {item:8170} a 430 {item:14047} k nasbírání nebo koupi.",
	["Artisan {skill:165}"] = "Artisan {skill:165}",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3756} (from 40, 1s 50c). Also learn {spell:1229432} (1s): Forever's {skill:165} camp item, 5 {item:2318}, placed at a campsite beside a campfire. The Camping 101: {skill:165} quest from your starting area's camping guide (after The Great Outdoors) sends you to a leatherworking trainer who teaches it free."] = "Zpět k trenérovi {skill:165}: {spell:3756} (od 40, 1s 50c). Nauč se i {spell:1229432} (1s): táborový předmět {skill:165} ve Foreveru, 5 {item:2318}, položený v kempu u táboráku. Quest Camping 101: {skill:165} od průvodce kempováním ve tvé startovní oblasti (po The Great Outdoors) tě pošle k trenérovi kožedělnictví, který ho naučí zdarma.",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:3780} (from 125, 7s 50c)."] = "Zpět k trenérovi {skill:165}: {spell:3780} (od 125, 7s 50c).",
	["Back to a {skill:165} trainer: {spell:9074} (from 95, 5s)."] = "Zpět k trenérovi {skill:165}: {spell:9074} (od 95, 5s).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 29 {item:2321} (29s), 66 Salt (33s) and 145 {item:4291} (7g 25s); about 7g 87s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 29 {item:2321} (29s), 66 Salt (33s) a 145 {item:4291} (7g 25s); celkem asi 7g 87s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} a {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} a {npc:5817}).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 39 {item:2325} (3g 90s) and 82 {item:14341} (41g); about 44g 90s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 39 {item:2325} (3g 90s) a 82 {item:14341} (41g); celkem asi 44g 90s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} a {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} a {npc:5817}).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 50 {item:2320} (5s); about 5s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 50 {item:2320} (5s); celkem asi 5s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} a {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} a {npc:5817}).",
	["Buy the whole bracket's share in one go: 70 {item:2320} (7s) and 50 {item:2321} (50s); about 57s in all. The arrow picks the nearest seller of your faction ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} and {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} and {npc:5817})."] = "Kup podíl celého pásma najednou: 70 {item:2320} (7s) a 50 {item:2321} (50s); celkem asi 57s. Šipka vybere nejbližšího prodejce tvé frakce ({zone:1453}: {npc:1347}, {npc:1286} a {npc:5565}; {zone:1454}: {npc:3364}, {npc:3367} a {npc:5817}).",
	["Expert raises the cap from 150 to 225; it needs {skill:165} 125 and character level 20, so you can take it on any visit from 125. Only a few trainers teach it: Alliance {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horde {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: {spell:3818} (from 125, 5s) and {spell:7151} (from 150). 150-225 takes about 5s of recipes and 7g 87s of vendor goods, plus 22 {item:4235} and 373 {item:4304} to gather or buy. Come with all of it in your bags (the steps above, the rest from the Auction House): these trainers also teach {item:5966} (from 165) and {item:8176} (from 180), and the crafts need no station, so craft right here and learn each recipe as you reach its skill. One trip instead of 3. {item:8193} (from 210) takes a second trip, to other trainers (below)."] = "Expert zvedne strop ze 150 na 225; potřebuje {skill:165} 125 a level postavy 20, takže ho můžeš vzít při jakékoli návštěvě od 125. Učí ho jen pár trenérů: Aliance {npc:4212} ({zone:1457}); Horda {npc:3007} ({zone:1456}). Šipka vybere nejbližšího z tvé frakce. Nauč se teď: {spell:3818} (od 125, 5s) a {spell:7151} (od 150). 150–225 stojí asi 5s za recepty a 7g 87s za zboží od obchodníků, plus 22 {item:4235} a 373 {item:4304} k nasbírání nebo koupi. Přijď se vším v taškách (kroky výše, zbytek z aukce): tihle trenéři učí i {item:5966} (od 165) a {item:8176} (od 180) a výroba nepotřebuje stanici, takže vyráběj přímo tady a každý recept se nauč, jakmile dosáhneš jeho dovednosti. Jedna cesta místo 3. {item:8193} (od 210) znamená druhou cestu, k jiným trenérům (níže).",
	["Expert {skill:165}"] = "Expert {skill:165}",
	["Journeyman {skill:165}"] = "Journeyman {skill:165}",
	["Learn {skill:165}"] = "Nauč se {skill:165}",
	["Still at the Expert trainer: {spell:10507} (from 180)."] = "Pořád u trenéra Expert: {spell:10507} (od 180).",
