	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Alterac Valley\" and the last two insignia, 400 reputation that no longer counts for anything but the insignia. {npc:13217} sells the {item:19030} (200g, level 60; its own guide), {item:19325} and {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) and the 50g tomes and off-hands."] = "Exalted dá Legacy Point „Master of Alterac Valley“ a poslední dvě insignie; 400 reputace, která už se nepočítá do ničeho kromě insignií. {npc:13217} prodává {item:19030} (200g, level 60; má vlastní návod), {item:19325} a {item:21563} (75g56s), {item:19323} (156g49s), {item:19321} (79g53s), {item:19324} (125g66s) a tomy a off-handy za 50g.",
