	["Dust Stormers and Desert Rumblers drift around the {area:2740} in the north-west of {zone:1451}. Each kill also pays 5 reputation while you are Neutral or Friendly, so stay if you mean to farm (next steps)."] = "Dust Stormers a Desert Rumblers se vznášejí kolem {area:2740} na severozápadě {zone:1451}. Každé zabití navíc dá 5 reputace, dokud jsi Neutral nebo Friendly, tak zůstaň, pokud chceš farmit (další kroky).",
