	["Belt, 20 Thorium Bars"] = "Pás, 20 Thorium Bars",
	["Blacksmiths with 265 skill can buy their way up with Thorium Bars: {npc:14567} in {area:976} trades the Imperial Plate plans for bars, and each pays Brotherhood reputation. {quest:7652} opens them (100). Belt 20 bars (100), Bracer 20 (100), Shoulders 20 (100), Boots 40 (150), Helm 50 (200), Chest 60 (200), Leggings 60 (200): 1,150 reputation for 270 Thorium Bars. They count at any standing, so do them before Burninate's turn-ins."] = "Kováři s dovedností 265 se můžou vykoupit Thorium Bars: {npc:14567} v {area:976} mění plány Imperial Plate za pruty a každý dá reputaci Brotherhood. Otevře je {quest:7652} (100). Pás 20 prutů (100), náramek 20 (100), ramena 20 (100), boty 40 (150), helma 50 (200), hruď 60 (200), kalhoty 60 (200): 1 150 reputace za 270 Thorium Bars. Počítají se na jakékoli reputaci, tak je udělej před odevzdáváním pro Burninate.",
	["Boots, 40 Thorium Bars"] = "Boty, 40 Thorium Bars",
	["Bracer, 20 Thorium Bars"] = "Náramek, 20 Thorium Bars",
	["Carry a {item:17203} ({npc:11988}, the {area:2717}) to {npc:12944} and he offers you a contract: ask about the offer and take it. Handing in the contract with the ingot pays 200 reputation and {item:18592}, the hammer Blacksmiths later join with the {item:17204} into {item:17182}."] = "Přines {item:17203} ({npc:11988}, {area:2717}) k {npc:12944} a nabídne ti smlouvu: zeptej se na nabídku a vezmi ji. Odevzdání smlouvy s ingotem dá 200 reputace a {item:18592}, kladivo, které kováři později spojí s {item:17204} na {item:17182}.",
	["Chest, 60 Thorium Bars"] = "Hruď, 60 Thorium Bars",
	["Coal, 1 per turn-in"] = "Coal, 1 za odevzdání",
	["The {item:11000}"] = "{item:11000}",
