	["Exalted gives the Legacy Point \"Master of Warsong Gulch\" and opens the epics: {item:19578} (plate), {item:19582} (mail), {item:19587} (leather) and {item:19595} (cloth) for levels 40, 50 and 60 (2g47s to 12g11s), and the level 60 Outrider's legs in plate, chain, mail, leather, lizardhide and silk (16g57s to 25g33s). The {item:19505} is 5g."] = "Exalted dá Legacy Point „Master of Warsong Gulch“ a otevře epiky: {item:19578} (plát), {item:19582} (mail), {item:19587} (kůže) a {item:19595} (látka) pro levely 40, 50 a 60 (2g47s až 12g11s) a nohavice Outrider's levelu 60 v plátu, chainu, mailu, kůži, lizardhide a hedvábí (16g57s až 25g33s). {item:19505} stojí 5g.",
